<p id="S1.T1.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">Complexity symbols: <math id="S1.T1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>S</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S</annotation></semantics></math>=sentences/doc, <math id="S1.T1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>=tokens/sent; <math id="S1.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>=total tokens/doc, <math id="S1.T1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>R</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math>=matching token pairs.</p></div></div>
</figure>
<div id="S1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">A new large-scale UN Parallel Corpus (2000–2023)</span>, which we believe is the largest publicly available parallel corpus verified to be free of AI-generated content, making it a uniquely valuable resource for training and evaluating MT systems in the current landscape.</p>
</div>
<div id="S1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">A complete, end-to-end, and fully open-source pipeline (UPRPRC)</span>, that is reproducible and extensible, hosted in Github at <a href="https://github.com/mnbvc-parallel-corpus-team/UPRPRC/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/mnbvc-parallel-corpus-team/UPRPRC/</a>. Handles complexities such as table structures, addressing long-standing issues in corpus creation.</p>
</div>
<div id="S1.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">The application of the GAPA algorithm for alignment</span>, demonstrates its superior time and space complexity allowing the processing of documents at a scale previously infeasible.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S2" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">2 </span>File Organization and Format</h2>

<div id="S2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The corpus is organized into three levels of granularity, each represented in specific formats, and is detailed below:</p>
</div>
